  <div class="question" data-question="5">
    <p>Q5. Why does each <code>mag_buf</code> start with <code>Modes.trailing_samples</code> of data copied from the previous buffer?</p>
    <ul class="options">
      <li data-correct="false" data-why="Crossfading is an audio concept. The overlap here solves a frame-detection boundary problem, not a click/pop problem.">To prevent audio clicks when the demodulator processes consecutive buffers</li>
